{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25001","headline":"寄永平友人 二 · 牟融","name":"寄永平友人 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朔风猎猎惨寒沙，关月寥寥咽暮笳。\n放逐一心终去国，驱驰千里未还家。\n青蝇点玉原非病，沧海遗珠世所嗟。\n直道未容淹屈久，暂劳踪迹寄天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}